  "contentHtml": "<figure><a href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/%24s_!w6Is!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5de5d442-0449-4f37-a82b-7e09457b3074_2756x748.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/%24s_!w6Is!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5de5d442-0449-4f37-a82b-7e09457b3074_2756x748.png\" width=\"1456\" height=\"395\" data-size=\"normal\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></figure>\n<p>In this space on Saturdays, I <a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/t/roundup\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">do a weekly round-up</a> of sorts: Sifting through what I wrote that you might have missed during the week, what I’ve been reading and watching myself, and some other fun things that have been going on.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/subscribe?\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p>\n<hr>\n<h4>📝 What I did this week</h4>\n<p><em>Here are the things I wrote or podcasted about during the previous week, sorted in descending order by quality, popularity and/or current relevance.</em></p>\n<p><strong>📊 My <a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/t/updating-model\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Odds/Models</a>: <a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/2026-nfl-odds-tracker-and-elo-ratings\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">NFL </a></strong>| <strong><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/2026-mlb-elo-power-ratings-playoff\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span>MLB </span></a></strong>| <strong><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/2026-wnba-elo-team-power-rankings\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span>WNBA</span> </a></strong>| <strong><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/2026-27-nba-elo-forecast-and-player\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">NBA</a></strong> | <strong><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/2026-27-nhl-team-elo-power-rankings\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">NHL </a></strong>| ✨<strong><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/2026-college-football-odds-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">CFB</a>✨</strong> | <strong><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/2026-27-english-premier-league-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">EPL</a> | <a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/2026-nascar-cup-series-driver-rankings\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span>NASCAR</span></a></strong></p>\n<ul><li><p>Check out the <strong><a href=\"https://view.newsletters.yahoo.net/messages/1795179229822a52b8e9228fd/raw\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Yahoo! Sports AM newsletter</a></strong> for my various charts and other contributions, including…</p><ul><li><p><strong><a href=\"https://view.newsletters.yahoo.net/messages/179483304479395ed30fc4b2c/raw\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">The CFP Field Is Shrinking Fast</a></strong></p></li><li><p><strong><a href=\"https://view.newsletters.yahoo.net/messages/179500644435961b361e68833/raw\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Home Sweet Home? Not Anymore</a></strong></p></li><li><p><strong><a href=\"https://view.newsletters.yahoo.net/messages/17950953026513dac2018f080/raw\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Making Every Shot Count</a></strong></p></li><li><p><strong><a href=\"https://view.newsletters.yahoo.net/messages/1795179229822a52b8e9228fd/raw\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">The NBA MVP Race Is a Two-Man Show</a></strong></p><figure><a href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/%24s_!lNa4!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3288461e-7542-4297-a17d-28ca8e8c2571_2400x1264.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/%24s_!lNa4!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3288461e-7542-4297-a17d-28ca8e8c2571_2400x1264.png\" width=\"1456\" height=\"767\" data-size=\"normal\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></figure></li></ul></li><li><p>🏈 <strong><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/ucla-is-currently-the-college-football\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">UCLA Is Currently the College Football Playoff’s Main Character </a></strong>– With the 10-0 Bruins surprisingly ranked No. 4 in the nation in their first year under coach Bob Chesney, I used <strong><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/2026-college-football-odds-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">my experimental CFP forecast model</a></strong> (see below) to show why UCLA carries the nation’s most consequential stretch run. Facing back-to-back high-leverage games against Michigan and USC, UCLA’s unique mix out outcomes range from securing a top-4 bye to missing the 12-team field altogether.<br></p></li><li><p>🏈 <strong><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/what-happened-to-home-field-advantage\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">What Happened to Home-Field Advantage? </a></strong>– After the winless Chargers went into Baltimore and won on MNF, I looked at data across sports to track the multi-decade decline of home-field advantage. NFL <strong>road</strong> teams have won over 51 percent of regulation games through Week 10 in 2026, showing just how much one of sports’ most reliable edges has eroded — due to factors ranging from less crowd intimidation on officiating to better sports science to manage travel.</p></li><li><p>⚾ <strong><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/dusty-bakers-greatness-followed-him\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Dusty Baker’s Greatness Followed Him Everywhere</a></strong> – Ahead of the Dec. 6 Hall of Fame Contemporary Baseball Era Committee vote, I made the Cooperstown case for Dusty Baker (in a field of fellow managerial candidates Bruce Bochy, Joe Maddon, and Lou Piniella). Beyond his 2,183 career wins and 2022 World Series title, Baker remains the only manager in MLB history to take five different franchises to the postseason.</p></li><li><p>🏒 <strong><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/connor-mcdavid-is-actually-making\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Connor McDavid Is Making 200 Points Seem Possible Again</a></strong> – Forty years after Wayne Gretzky last hit the 200-point threshold, Connor McDavid found himself tracking directly with the Great One’s historic scoring pace with 53 points through Edmonton’s first 22 games. I broke down his game-by-game scoring rate and showed how the NHL’s expanded 84-game schedule could give McDavid the extra runway needed to accomplish one of hockey’s ultimate milestones.</p></li><li><p>🏈 <strong><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/justin-herberts-collapse-is-in-historically\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Justin Herbert’s Collapse Is in Historically Bad Company</a></strong> – Following the 0-8 Chargers’ slide into irrelevance ahead of Monday Night Football, I analyzed Justin Herbert’s unprecedented mid-prime regression. <a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/i/207468984/nfl-qb-epa-ratings\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Judged by QB EPAR</a>, Herbert is posting one of the worst full-season figures in post-merger database history and has the single largest year-over-year drop for a quarterback who topped 100 EPAR per 17 starts the prior year.</p></li></ul>\n<h4>📊 Charts of the week:</h4>\n<p>Here were some of my favorite viz items of the week from <em><strong><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/scoreboard-newsletter-archives\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Scoreboard</a></strong></em>, my daily newsletter for <a href=\"https://sherwood.news/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Sherwood News</a>… </p>\n<p><strong>🏈</strong><em><strong> On Scorigami <a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/i/225206523/chart-of-the-day\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">added in recent NFL seasons</a>…</strong></em></p>\n<div class=\"reader-datawrapper\"><a href=\"https://datawrapper.dwcdn.net/6IC9I/1/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/30ed4c0b-4f95-486c-bc5c-afa4f3f36556_1220x958.png\" alt=\"Put these new scores in the books\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><p>Put these new scores in the books</p></div>\n<p><strong>🏆</strong><em><strong> On whether defense is <a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/i/225352203/find-the-edge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">actually winning more championships recently</a>…</strong></em></p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/%24s_!RRmI!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb0a33f0f-2d67-42cf-b6e1-6e4c8a2ab4e6_1900x1566.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/%24s_!RRmI!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb0a33f0f-2d67-42cf-b6e1-6e4c8a2ab4e6_1900x1566.png\" width=\"1456\" height=\"1200\" data-size=\"normal\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></figure>\n<p>🎮<strong> </strong><em><strong>On <a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/i/225651608/find-the-edge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">sports’ GTA Generation</a>…</strong></em></p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/%24s_!6lzl!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa6bd2445-6ba2-47f1-b54d-e9354d6e3858_1860x1335.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/%24s_!6lzl!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa6bd2445-6ba2-47f1-b54d-e9354d6e3858_1860x1335.png\" width=\"1456\" height=\"1045\" data-size=\"normal\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/%24s_!7sUe!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F446bfccc-4f6b-434b-859e-85eea6ca103e_1860x1155.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/%24s_!7sUe!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F446bfccc-4f6b-434b-859e-85eea6ca103e_1860x1155.png\" width=\"1456\" height=\"904\" data-size=\"normal\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></figure>\n<p><em><br>Subscribe to <strong>Scoreboard</strong> by <strong><a href=\"https://join.sherwood.news/scoreboard\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">clicking here</a></strong>!</em></p>\n<h4>👀 Some interesting things I read/watched this week</h4>\n<p><em>A collection of articles (with a heavy focus on my fellow Substackers), videos and other media that I enjoyed and/or found thought-provoking over the past week. I don’t always 100% agree with or endorse what’s linked here… but that’s also sort of the point.</em></p>\n<ul><li><p>🏈 <strong><a href=\"https://frontporchsports.substack.com/p/meet-the-worst-defense-in-college?utm_source=post-email-title&amp;publication_id=1460693&amp;post_id=225751878&amp;utm_campaign=email-post-title&amp;isFreemail=false&amp;r=gwh9&amp;triedRedirect=true&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">“Meet the worst defense in college football this season (and maybe of all-time)”</a></strong> by 